advanced.description:
{Advanced Runes}

Advanced Runes allow hero's units to accumulate up to 6 Rune Levels in combat. Each Rune Level gives bonuses to the creature stats:

{1}: +2 attack, {2}: +2 defence, {3}: +1 speed;
{4}: +2 attack, {5}: +2 defence, {6}: +1 speed.

The bonuses of all achieved Rune Levels are cumulative. The unit gains +1 Rune Level when it attacks; +2 Rune Levels when it takes damage; +3 Rune Levels when it takes a defensive stance.

expert.description:
{Expert Runes}

Expert Runes allow hero's units to accumulate up to 9 Rune Levels in combat. Each Rune Level gives bonuses to the creature stats:

{1}: +2 attack, {2}: +2 defence, {3}: +1 speed;
{4}: +2 attack, {5}: +2 defence, {6}: +1 speed;
{7}: +2 attack, {8}: +2 defence, {9}: +1 speed.

The bonuses of all achieved Rune Levels are cumulative. The unit gains +1 Rune Level when it attacks; +2 Rune Levels when it takes damage; +3 Rune Levels when it takes a defensive stance.
